---
// Route by need right after the hero, ranked (Gate 9 item 7: no row of equal cards). Planned visits are the
// main path, to the callback request; a sick visit is a call, because a callback is too slow.
// The request form stays contact-only, so the visit reason is not carried into it (CLAUDE.md red line).
import Section from '../Section.astro'
import Icon from '../Icon.astro'
---
<Section id="visits">
  <h2 class="text-[1.9rem] md:text-4xl">What brings you in?</h2>
  <div class="mt-6 md:mt-10 md:grid md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr] md:items-end md:gap-12">
    <div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-line bg-white p-6 md:p-8">
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">Planning a visit</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-[38ch] md:text-lg">Checkups, physicals, a new baby or vaccines. Send a short request with your name and number, and the office calls you back.</p>
      <a href="#request" class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-teal-deep underline underline-offset-4">Request a visit<Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-indigo pl-4 md:mt-0 md:pb-2 md:text-lg"><strong class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-indigo md:text-2xl">Sick today?</strong><br />
      Don't wait for a callback. <a href="/locations" data-call class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-teal-deep underline underline-offset-4"><Icon name="phone" size={16} />Call an office</a><br />
      In an emergency, call 911.</p>
  </div>
</Section>
